            "reviewBody": "This was very easy and delicious! I added 1/2 serrano pepper (seeded and chopped) for 15 minutes while shaking and stirring and then strained the pepper pieces out. Created a nice heat that could easily be adjusted! VERY VERY GOOD will make over and over!",
