              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SmartStew8436"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved the simplicity of this recipe, but did make a few changes... I like a sweeter dressing, so I only used 1 Tbls balsamic vinegar and upped the honey to 4 teaspoons. I also used poppy seeds instead of black pepper. Absolutely wonderful over a spinach salad with walnuts, apples and egg slices! I may never buy store dressing again!! ;)",
