            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kathy Kerr Vetro"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I originally made the recipe as is. I missed olive oil, so yesterday I added a crushed clove of garlic and two tablespoons of extra virgin olive oil. Really made it even better. Since I am now working from home at least for the next 4 - 6 weeks, I am hoping eat salads every day at lunchtime. These interesting dressings should make it easier.",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-13T11:12:26.207Z"
          },
          {
