            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a really nice, refreshing vinaigrette. I added 1 Tbsp. extra virgin olive oil and used sugar instead of honey. I used regular orange juice (NOT concentrate). Served it on a salad of romaine, spinach, clementines, almonds and feta cheese. Very nice!",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-16T14:00:56.460Z"
          },
